## ## 5.5 Using Files for Data Storage
- **File Storage:** Marka barnaamijku u baahan yahay inuu kaydiyo xogta dambe, wuxuu u qoraa fayl dhexdiis.
- **Saddexda Tillaabo:** Waxaa had iyo jeer la raacaa: Furitaanka faylka (Open), Ka shaqaynta faylka (Process - qorid ama akhris), iyo Xiritaanka faylka (Close).
- **StreamWriter:** Fasalka .NET u diyaariyey si xogta loogu qoro fayl qoraal ah (Text file).
- **StreamReader:** Fasalka .NET u diyaariyey si xogta looga akhriyo fayl qoraal ah.
- **EndOfStream:** Waa sifo Boolean ah oo laga dhex helo StreamReader, waxayna sheegtaa in dhammaadkii faylka la gaaray iyo in kale.

```csharp
// Qorista Faylka
StreamWriter outputFile = File.CreateText("courses.txt");
outputFile.WriteLine("Introduction to Computer Science");
outputFile.Close();

// Akhriska Faylka iyadoo Loop la isticmaalayo
StreamReader inputFile = File.OpenText("students.txt");
while (inputFile.EndOfStream == false)
{
    string line = inputFile.ReadLine();
}
inputFile.Close();
```

