## ## 5.6 The OpenFileDialog and SaveFileDialog Controls
- **Invisible Controls:** Waa kontoroollo aan foomka si toos ah uga muuqan laakiin u oggolaanaya barnaamijka inuu muujiyo daaqadaha caadiga ah ee Windows ee faylasha lagu furo ama lagu kaydiyo.
- **ShowDialog():** Waa habka (method) loo wacdo si loo muujiyo daaqadda interface-ka ah.
- **DialogResult.OK:** Waxay muujisaa in isticmaalahu uu gujiyey badhanka "Open" ama "Save".

