## ## 5.7 Random Numbers
- **Random Class:** Waa fasalka loo isticmaalo in lagu soo saaro lambarro aan kala sooc lahayn (random numbers).
- **Next Method:** Wuxuu soo saaraa lambar guud (integer) oo random ah.
- **NextDouble Method:** Wuxuu soo saaraa lambar jajab ah (floating-point) oo u dhexeeya 0.0 iyo 1.0.

```csharp
Random rand = new Random();
int number = rand.Next(100); // Wuxuu soo saaraa lambar u dhexeeya 0 ilaa 99
```

